@startuml visao-logica-contextos-sg3-v1
' Visão Lógica (DAS 1.1.1.5) — detalhe dos contextos da SubEquipe_03:
' identidade, transmissao/canal, chat e moderacao.
' Autoria: SubEquipe_01 (Lucas Andrade Zanetti, Matheus Lemes Amaral,
' Pedro Druck Montalvão Reis, Heitor Macedo Ricardo), 2026. Versão 1 — rascunho
' a validar pela SubEquipe_03 (Hugo Freitas Silva e Philipe Amâncio Reis Caetano).
' Classes da E03: g6-streaming-entrega03-subgrupo03-codigo @ d2860ff.

title Visão Lógica — contextos da SubEquipe_03 (identidade, canal, chat e moderação), v1

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam packageStyle folder
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
skinparam package {
  BackgroundColor<<SG3>> #FFE6CC
  BackgroundColor<<kernel>> #F5F5F5
}
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor<<a implementar>> #FFFFFF
  BorderColor<<a implementar>> #999999
  BackgroundColor<<port>> #FFFFFF
}

package "@g6/shared-kernel" as kernel <<kernel>> {
  interface AutenticacaoPort <<port>>
  interface ChatPort <<port>>
  interface ModeracaoPort <<port>>
  interface EventBus <<port>>
  class MensagemChat <<DTO>>
  class VereditoModeracao <<DTO>> {
    decisao: aprovada | quarentena | bloqueada
    motivo: string
  }
}

package "@g6/identidade (#5)" as identidade <<SG3>> {
  interface AuthenticationHandler <<Handler>>
  abstract class AbstractAuthenticationHandler
  class RateLimitHandler <<ConcreteHandler>>
  class ClientIntegrityHandler <<ConcreteHandler>>
  class PasswordHandler <<ConcreteHandler>>
  class LeakedPasswordHandler <<ConcreteHandler>>
  class AccountStatusHandler <<ConcreteHandler>>
  class TwoFactorHandler <<ConcreteHandler>>
  class StepUpGrantHandler <<ConcreteHandler>>
  class SessionIssuerHandler <<ConcreteHandler>>
  class LoginService <<Client>>
  class AutenticacaoService <<a implementar>>
}

package "@g6/transmissao :: canal (#7)" as canal <<SG3>> {
  interface ISubject <<Subject>>
  interface IObserver <<Observer>>
  class StreamChannel <<ConcreteSubject>>
  interface INotificationDispatchStrategy <<Strategy>>
  class AsynchronousConcurrentDispatchStrategy <<ConcreteStrategy>>
  class SynchronousBlockingDispatchStrategy <<ConcreteStrategy>>
}

package "@g6/chat (#13)" as chat <<SG3>> {
  class ChatRoom <<Subject>>
  interface ChatObserver <<Observer>>
  class ChatDeliveryService <<ConcreteObserver>>
  class QuarantineQueue
  class ChatAuditService
  class ChatService <<a implementar>>
}

package "@g6/moderacao (#14)" as moderacao <<SG3>> {
  interface AutoModPipeline
  class ModeracaoService <<a implementar>>
}

' Chain of Responsibility
AbstractAuthenticationHandler ..|> AuthenticationHandler
AbstractAuthenticationHandler o--> "0..1 próximo" AuthenticationHandler
RateLimitHandler --|> AbstractAuthenticationHandler
ClientIntegrityHandler --|> AbstractAuthenticationHandler
PasswordHandler --|> AbstractAuthenticationHandler
LeakedPasswordHandler --|> AbstractAuthenticationHandler
AccountStatusHandler --|> AbstractAuthenticationHandler
TwoFactorHandler --|> AbstractAuthenticationHandler
StepUpGrantHandler --|> AbstractAuthenticationHandler
SessionIssuerHandler --|> AbstractAuthenticationHandler
LoginService ..> AuthenticationHandler
AutenticacaoService ..|> AutenticacaoPort
AutenticacaoService ..> LoginService

' Observer + Strategy no canal
StreamChannel ..|> ISubject
StreamChannel o--> "*" IObserver
StreamChannel o--> INotificationDispatchStrategy
AsynchronousConcurrentDispatchStrategy ..|> INotificationDispatchStrategy
SynchronousBlockingDispatchStrategy ..|> INotificationDispatchStrategy
StreamChannel ..> EventBus : <<publica>>\nLiveIniciada / LiveEncerrada

' Observer no chat, moderação por port
ChatRoom o--> "*" ChatObserver
ChatDeliveryService ..|> ChatObserver
ChatRoom --> QuarantineQueue : quarentena
ChatRoom --> ChatAuditService : auditoria
ChatService ..|> ChatPort
ChatService --> ChatRoom
ChatService ..> ModeracaoPort : <<use>>\nantes de entregar
ChatService ..> EventBus : <<publica>>\nMensagemPublicada

' Moderação
ModeracaoService ..|> ModeracaoPort
ModeracaoService --> AutoModPipeline
ModeracaoPort ..> MensagemChat
ModeracaoPort ..> VereditoModeracao

note bottom of moderacao
  Na E03, AutoModPipeline importava ChatMessage do chat
  e ChatRoom importava ModerationDecision da moderação:
  ciclo chat ↔ moderação. Com MensagemChat e VereditoModeracao
  no kernel, a dependência passa a ter um só sentido (chat → port).
end note

note right of canal
  Os observadores de moderação de vídeo do StreamChannel
  (AutoModObserver, SafetyVisionModerationObserver etc.)
  não podem importar @g6/moderacao (RD3): ficam no canal
  ou são ligados por apps/*. Ponto em aberto da #7.
end note

@enduml
